<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<p>Whether you're remodeling in Arcadia, building new in Gilbert or Queen Creek, or specifying a handleless German kitchen in Scottsdale, this guide covers the brands available in Arizona, the looks that work in the desert, and where to see them in person.</p>
<h2 id="find-a-kitchen-cabinet-showroom-near-you">Find a Kitchen Cabinet Showroom Near You</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales brands are sold through independent local showrooms across Arizona. Tell us your project and where you're located, and we'll connect you with the nearest authorized dealer.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Find a Local Dealer</a></p>
<h2 id="premium-cabinetry-brands-available-in-arizona">Premium Cabinetry Brands Available in Arizona</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — American-made face-frame, inset, and custom paint; the versatile choice for Arizona's transitional and warm-contemporary kitchens.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access construction for the clean modern look that suits desert-contemporary architecture.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom built for Arizona's high new-construction volume in Gilbert, Buckeye, and Queen Creek.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless, precision-engineered fronts for high-end Scottsdale and Paradise Valley projects.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage to finish the whole home.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="arizona-kitchen-design-trends">Arizona Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Arizona kitchens lean warm-contemporary: crisp white and greige perimeters paired with warm walnut or rift oak on islands, large-format porcelain, and indoor-outdoor flow built for the climate. New-construction communities across the East Valley drive heavy demand for semi-custom value, while the luxury market in Scottsdale, Paradise Valley, and North Phoenix increasingly wants handleless European fronts and flat-slab contemporary cabinetry. The <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless full-access</a> look pairs naturally with the region's clean desert-modern architecture.</p>
